# curse-no-healing in the Zethos fight (event battle 6), Jian alone, story flag 0x33 on. Every round Jian uses a
# Healing Gum on himself: rounds 0 to 2 it does nothing and goes back in the bag; from round 3 Zethos's skill
# 21 clears the battle curse flag (0x020B8614) and the Gum heals. Round counter: battle ctx +0x0A (0x020B85C2).
# Jian 400 of 999 HP, strong stats. Battle Jian at [0x020B8620] (0x0228E860 in these runs): HP +0x14.
include boot_from_save
pin u16 0x020B464C 0
pin u16 0x020B4650 65535
pin u16 0x020B4654 65535
pin u32 0x020B466C 999
pin u8 0x020B4678 255
pin u8 0x020B467C 255
pin u8 0x020B4684 255
pin u8 0x020B468C 255
poke u32 0x020B4668 400
poke u8 0x0213BA43 20
poke u32 0x02204624 0x80000
# warp6 without the final move onto an enemy spawn point (as boss_gronk.plan)
pin u16 0x020B77EC 6
press Right 40
press Down,Right 40
press Right 40
press Down 80
wait 200
unpin
wait 30
poke u16 0x020B7838 1
poke u16 0x020B783A 6
poke u32 0x020B0010 0x73
wait 240
peek u32 0x020B8620 battle_chars
peek u16 0x020B85BE event_battle_id
battlers
watch u16 0x020B8614 battle_curse
watch u16 0x020B85C2 round
watch u32 0x0228E874 jian_hp
watch u8 0x0213BA43 gum_count
shot z_start
press A 8
wait 60
press Down 8
wait 30
press A 8
wait 60
press A 8
wait 60
